      <title>刘烈宏提出词元增值订阅与按效付费模式 直指国民经济重大场景</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260830/%E5%88%98%E7%83%88%E5%AE%8F%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%8D%E5%85%83%E5%A2%9E%E5%80%BC%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E4%B8%8E%E6%8C%89%E6%95%88%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%B9%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F-%E7%9B%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF/</link>
